  "articleBody": "A reliable renovation budget starts with a defined scope, realistic allowances for selections, permitting and design, and a reserve for conditions that are not visible before demolition. Compare complete proposals—not just construction totals—and confirm what each includes, who handles permits, how changes are priced, and when payments are due.",
